{"text": "English 53 Maintenance Cleaning Interior and exterior WARNING \u2022 Do not use benzene, thinner, or home/car detergent such as Clorox\u2122 for cleaning purposes. They may damage the surface of the refrigerator and cause a fire. \u2022 Do not spray water onto the refrigerator. This may cause electric shock. Regularly use a dry cloth to remove all foreign substances such as dust or water from the power plug terminals and contact points. 1. Unplug the power cord. 2. Use a moistened, soft, lint-free cloth or paper towel to clean the refrigerator\u2019s interior and exterior. 3. When done, use a dry cloth or paper towel to dry well. 4. Plug in the power cord. Replacement LED Lamps To replace the lamps of the refrigerator, contact a local Samsung service centre. WARNING \u2022 The lamps are not user-serviceable. Do not attempt to replace a lamp yourself. This can cause electric shock. Untitled-3 53 2021-12-23 (cid:31)(cid:31) 4:53:42", "source": "D:\\Study\\4_Forth Semester\\AI\\project\\MultiAgent_RAG\\data\\1 Door Refrigerator Non Plumbed Dispenser 375L User Manual.pdf", "page": 52}